I consider that an implementation detail. In my head, the impl looked something like this:

```C#
        public static bool IsOSPlatform(string platform)
            => RuntimeInformation.IsOSPlatform(new OSPlatform(platform));
        public static bool IsOSPlatformVersionAtLeast(string platform, int major, int minor = 0, int build = 0, int revision = 0)
            => IsOSPlatform(platform) && Environment.OSVersion.Version >= new Version(major, minor, build, revision);

        public static bool IsFreeBSD()
            => ISPlatform("FreeBSD");
        public static bool IsFreeBSDVersionAtLeast(int major, int minor = 0, int build = 0, int revision = 0);
            => ISPlatform("FreeBSD", major, minor, build, revision);

        ...
```
